# Steamvent Harbour - the third island of the library's plan The Frozen Horizon (storyline SL12, chapter 3: The Warm Harbour)
# A harbour town huddled round a geothermal vent: steam rising from a fissure in the square, iron pipes laid from it to
# the houses, the ground round it warm enough for a garden of fruit and flowers in the snow. A glass greenhouse grew shut
# with jungle vines (the machete is in the harbour store), a boiler house, a pipe store full of rats, a hen coop and a
# town hall that has been cold since the valve stuck. Quest "The Warm Harbour" (15 steps): the quay, the harbour master's
# notice, the machete's plans, the vines and the greenhouse, the gardener's log, the fuel tank's plans (boiler house), the
# rats, the fuel pipe's plans (pipe store), DEEP 10-24: the driller's warning (steam cave), the antenna cables and the
# bathhouse hub, the derrick's relief valve (Fumarole Mountain), the vent valve (steam back to the houses), the biofuel extractor's plans
# (town hall locker), the town meeting minutes.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe steamvent_harbour) through the editor's own operations. Points (metres over the
# sea): the town at 3 m (r 22 round 0 0), the vent in its middle; the quay at 1.2 m round 0 -38; the harbour store
# x -12..-7.5 z -16..-13; the greenhouse x 14..20 z -6.5..2.5 (door south at 15.5 -6.5); the boiler house x -22..-17.5
# z 2..6.5; the pipe store x 6..10.5 z 12..16.5; the town hall x -6..0 z 10..14.5; the hen coop round -18 18.
include lib_sea
include lib_huts
include lib_rt
include lib_features
include lib_frozen
include lib_areas
# RESIZE 10-24: Radius 46 -> 90 (Height 7 -> 8), the old content moved 0 -24.2 as one frame (push) so its sea side stays at the coast; the island grows behind it.
new
gen Trees=0.06 Bushes=0.2 Rocks=0.3 Harvest=0.2 BeachThings=0.3
gen Seed=12301 Radius=90 Height=8 Roughness=0.4 Peaks=2 Shape=0 Style=1 BeachWidth=0.25 Cliffs=0.35 PeakShape=0.5
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.3 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.2 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0.3
generate

# --- DEEP 10-24 (one-hour pass): the island behind the town. Fumarole Mountain in the north (30 m) with the geothermal
# derrick on it (6 ladders, top 44.5 m: the relief valve that bleeds the vent); the bathhouse at its foot (its door
# wired shut - the derrick's power line); the three antenna masts (M25, RAFT_QUEST_MECHANICS 4: the storm brought their
# cables down, a polar bear by each; 2 cables a mast; the bathhouse hub takes 4, the greenhouse hub 2); the driller's
# steam cave in the west; the pumphouse ruin north-east; the sunk steam ferry east (12 m down); two buried treasures.
# Built before the town so the town, the camp and the dirt sit on the final ground.
call fz_mount x=10 z=62 h=30 r=7
call ar_plants_snowy x=10 z=62 r=28 seed=12401
call fz_tower x=10 z=64 h=30 n=6 al=derrick chest=derrickchest zal=derrickzone zid=derrick_top msg="The derrick's top. The vent's pipe climbs here from the town - and the relief valve's housing sits on it, clamped shut."
place Note_Sign derricksign at 9.2 62.4 h=44.57 sit yaw=180
# the ridge west of the mountain (the ridge mast) and the east rise (the east mast)
call ar_ridge x1=-44 z1=58 x2=-12 z2=70 h=10 top=6 r=8
call ar_plants_snowy x=-28 z=64 r=24 seed=12402
call ar_ridge x1=38 z1=-4 x2=60 z2=14 h=9 top=5 r=7
call ar_plants_snowy x=49 z=5 r=18 seed=12403
# the three antenna masts, a bear by each, a cable box at each foot
