# --- DEEP 10-24: the mountain, the masts, the bathhouse, the cave, the ruin, the ferry ---
story cable|Antenna cable|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|A coil of the antenna masts' cable. The storm brought it down; a wire hub takes it.
story bathpower|The derrick's power line|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The bathhouse hub wired: power runs up the mountain to the derrick again.
story relief|Relief valve|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|The derrick's relief valve. With it on the vent, the valve can be turned without blowing the pipes.
note drillwarn Driller's warning | DRILLER'S WARNING\n\nDO NOT FORCE THE VENT VALVE. The vent is over pressure - turn it now and the pipes burst under the square.\nBleed it first: the relief valve is on the derrick, top of Fumarole Mountain.\nThe valve's housing is clamped by the power line from the bathhouse. The storm took the line down: its cable was strung on the three antenna masts (the ridge, the north-east, the east rise).\nTwo coils from each mast. The bathhouse hub takes four.\nBears den by the masts in winter. Mind them.
note bathslate Bath keeper's slate | BATHHOUSE\n\nHot water from the derrick, free to all.\nThe hub outside powers the derrick's clamps - when the line is up the clamps let go of the relief valve.\nThe greenhouse has its own hub for the heat lamps. Two coils.
note derricksign The derrick | FUMAROLE DERRICK\n\nRelief valve in the housing. Carry it down and fit it on the vent valve before you turn it.\nThe quick way down is the way the steam goes: down the mountain's south face.
note pumpledger Pump keeper's ledger | PUMP KEEPER'S LEDGER\n\nPump stopped - the basin flooded when the ferry went down in it.\nThe ferry's strongbox is still aboard. Twelve metres. There's air on the boat's west side if you need it.\nSpare tools buried by the north shore, under the white rock.
note mastridgebox Ridge mast's cable box | The ridge mast's cable box: two coils of the antenna line, rimed with frost.
loot mastridgebox story:cable*2;Bolt*1
prop mastridgebox loot.refill=0
note mastnebox North-east mast's cable box | The north-east mast's cable box: two coils of the antenna line.
loot mastnebox story:cable*2;Rope*1
prop mastnebox loot.refill=0
note masteastbox East mast's cable box | The east mast's cable box: two coils of the antenna line and a pair of pliers.
loot masteastbox story:cable*2;Nail*6
prop masteastbox loot.refill=0
note derrickchest Derrick valve housing | The relief valve's housing on the derrick: the valve itself, and the driller's spare tools.
loot derrickchest story:relief*1;MetalIngot*2;CopperIngot*2
prop derrickchest loot.refill=0
prop derrickchest if.open=signal|bathpower
prop derrickchest else.open=message||The housing is clamped shut. The clamps are electric - the power line comes up from the bathhouse.
note bathlocker Bath keeper's locker | The bath keeper's locker: towels, soap, a tin of tea and the keeper's savings.
loot bathlocker Wool*3;Raw_GenericMeat*2;MetalIngot*1
prop bathlocker loot.refill=0
note steamcavechest Driller's kit | The driller's kit in the steam cave: a drill bit, a lamp, his lunch tin.
loot steamcavechest Scrap*3;Bolt*2;Raw_GenericMeat*1
prop steamcavechest loot.refill=0
note ferrychest Ferry's strongbox | The steam ferry's strongbox, twelve metres down: the fares and the cargo's best.
loot ferrychest MetalIngot*3;Glass*2;CopperIngot*2
prop treasure12411 treasure.loot=MetalOre*3;CopperOre*2
prop treasure12412 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*1;MetalOre*2
prop bathdoor obj.name=bathdoor
prop bathhub obj.name=bathhub
prop bathhub beh.use=Wire the derrick's power line
prop bathhub if.use=!signal|bathpower\ntake|story:cable|4
prop bathhub on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nmessage||Four coils clamped in. The hub hums, the bathhouse door unlocks - and up on the mountain, the derrick's clamps click open.\nsignal||bathpower\ngive||story:bathpower*1\nhide|bathdoor
prop bathhub else.use=message||A wire hub with four empty clamps: the derrick's power line. The antenna masts carried its cables.
prop bathsteam atmo.particles=mist
prop bathsteam atmo.fog=#e4e6e6
prop bathsteam atmo.fogAmount=0.3
prop bathsteam zone.radius=4
prop bathzone zone.id=bathhouse
prop bathzone zone.radius=3
prop bathzone zone.message=The bathhouse: a hot pool under a steaming roof. Warm, at last.
prop steamcavez zone.id=steam_cave
prop steamcavez zone.radius=3
prop steamcavez zone.message=The driller's cave: warm rock, steam seeping from the cracks. A note pinned by the lamp.
