# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest -----------------------------------------------------------------
info title=Steamvent Harbour
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A harbour town round a steaming vent in the snow: pipes to every house, a fruit garden on the warm ground, a glass greenhouse grown shut with vines and a valve that stuck. The third island of The Frozen Horizon.
island on.arrive=message||Steam rising from a town square - and round it, in the snow, a garden.

story wheelpiece|Handwheel piece|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|A piece of the vent valve's handwheel. The harbour master took it apart to stop the frozen valve being forced.
story steam|Steam to the houses|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|You opened the vent valve: steam runs to every house in the harbour again.

note notice Harbour master's notice | STEAMVENT HARBOUR - NOTICE\n\nThe vent valve has stuck. The houses are cold.\nThe greenhouse door has grown shut - jungle vines, the heat did it. A machete is in the harbour store.\nRats in the pipe store. Mind your fingers.\nTown meeting in the hall once the steam is back.\n\n- Harbour master
note harbourstore Harbour store | The harbour store: a machete in oilcloth, the plans for making more, and rope.
note greenstore Greenhouse store | The gardener's store: seed packets, potatoes for planting, a jar of last year's honey.
note gardenerlog Gardener's log | GREENHOUSE LOG\n\nThe vent keeps it at summer heat all winter. Bananas, berries, roses.\nThe vines came in with a crate of bananas, a stowaway. Now they've grown over the door.\nThe boiler house has the fuel plans; the pipe store, the pipes - but the rats have it now.\nThe valve on the square feeds the houses. It sticks in the cold. Turn it hard.
note boilerhouse Boiler house | The boiler house chest: the fuel tank's plans, a can of fuel, bolts.
note pipestore Pipe store | The pipe store's chest, gnawed at the corners: the plans for fuel pipes and a bundle of copper.
note townlocker Steam-house locker | The town hall's locker, its frozen lock thawed by the steam: the biofuel extractor's plans - "the harbour's own oil".
note minutes Town meeting minutes | TOWN MEETING - MINUTES\n\nSteam back thanks to a stranger.\nAgreed: we take the sledges to Orrin's camp on the shelf ice, and from there to the Whale. The Whale's captain kept the vault's charts.\nOrrin is on 900.\nAgreed: the greenhouse feeds whoever stays.
loot harbourstore Blueprint_Machete*1;Machete*1;Rope*2
prop harbourstore loot.refill=0
loot greenstore story:wheelpiece*1;Seed_Banana*2;Seed_Strawberry*2;Seed_Flower_Red*1;Seed_Flower_Blue*1;Raw_Potato*3
prop greenstore loot.refill=0
loot boilerhouse Blueprint_Fueltank*1;Bolt*2;Scrap*2;story:wheelpiece*1
prop boilerhouse loot.refill=0
loot pipestore Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel*1;CopperIngot*2;Scrap*2;story:wheelpiece*1
prop pipestore loot.refill=0
loot townlocker Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor*1;MetalIngot*2;Bolt*2
prop townlocker loot.refill=0

