prop greenzone zone.message=The greenhouse: summer air, bananas, roses - and bees.
prop pipezone zone.id=pipestore
prop pipezone zone.radius=4
prop pipezone zone.repeat=never
prop pipezone zone.message=Rats! The pipe store is full of them.
prop rats creature.count=4
prop rats creature.respawn=0
prop rats creature.zone=pipestore
prop hens creature.count=3

prop ventvalve obj.name=ventvalve
prop ventvalve beh.use=Turn the vent valve
prop ventvalve if.use=!signal|steam\ntake|story:wheelpiece|3\ntake|story:relief|1
prop ventvalve on.use=message||The valve groans, gives - and steam hisses down the pipes. One by one the houses' chimneys breathe.\nsignal||steam\ngive||story:steam*1\nshow|steamhouses\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct
prop ventvalve else.use=message||The valve is open and the town is warm - or it is not ready: its handwheel is in three pieces (the greenhouse, the boiler house, the pipe store), and the vent wants its relief valve first (the driller's cave, west, says why).
prop steamhouses obj.name=steamhouses
prop townlocker obj.name=townlocker
prop townlocker if.open=signal|steam
prop townlocker else.open=message||The locker's lock is frozen solid. The hall needs its steam back.

quest title=The Warm Harbour
quest intro=A town round a steaming vent, its houses cold. Tie up at the quay.
step reach|quay|1|Tie up at the harbour quay
step read|Harbour master's notice|1|Read the harbour master's notice
step blueprint|Blueprint_Machete|1|Take the machete's plans from the harbour store
step reach|greenhouse|1|Cut the vines and go into the greenhouse
step read|Gardener's log|1|Read the gardener's log
step blueprint|Blueprint_Fueltank|1|Take the fuel tank's plans from the boiler house
step kill|Rat|4|Clear the rats out of the pipe store
step blueprint|Blueprint_Pipe_Fuel|1|Take the fuel pipe's plans from the pipe store
step collect|story:wheelpiece|3|Find the valve handwheel's three pieces (greenhouse, boiler house, pipe store)
step read|Driller's warning|1|The vent hisses too hard to turn. Find the driller's cave in the west and read his warning
step collect|story:bathpower|1|Bring four antenna cables from the masts (mind the bears) to the bathhouse's wire hub
step collect|story:relief|1|Climb Fumarole Mountain and the derrick; take the relief valve from its housing
step collect|story:steam|1|Turn the vent valve on the square
step blueprint|Blueprint_BiofuelExtractor|1|Take the biofuel extractor's plans from the town hall's locker
step read|Town meeting minutes|1|Read the town meeting minutes
quest done=The town goes to Orrin's sledge camp on the shelf ice - and then to the Whale. Orrin is on 900.
quest reward=MetalIngot*2;Rope*4;Egg*2

